  // TASK-31: E — leave the ship. Only fires when the docked prompt is showing
  // (state/docked store is true ⇒ the player's own entity is a docked ship),
  // and when the star chart is closed. Never fires while typing (in chat).
  // The request is a plain 'exit_ship' frame — the server rejects it with
